                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} a_1, a_2 \;\in\; \{1, \cdots, n\}
            %p
              and equipped with the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutator+bracket"} commutator bracket
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
